# 1. PRIMARY OBJECTIVE & ARCHITECTURAL PHILOSOPHY

This document provides a **complete, repository-derived behavioral and architectural specification** of the Bento block editor implemented in this repository. 

The Bento experience in this repository is built as a **declarative, mathematical 4-column absolute-positioning grid builder** with continuous pointer-based drag-and-drop, dynamic 4-axis handle resizing, collision detection with pushing physics, optional upward gravity compaction, and real-time social widget loading.

