# 12. CONTAINER QUERIES & RESPONSIVE BEHAVIOR

The Bento grid uses responsive breakpoint adaptations:

```css
/* Desktop: Full 4-Column Absolute Grid */
.bento-grid-layout-new {
    /* Absolute Positioning calculations active */
}

/* Tablet Breakpoint (max-width: 900px) */
@media (max-width: 900px) {
    .bento-grid-layout-new {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
        grid-auto-rows: minmax(140px, auto);
        gap: 16px;
    }
    .bento-card-base {
        grid-column: span var(--tablet-span, 1) !important;
        height: auto !important;
    }
    .bento-git-card-new, .bento-banner-card-new {
        flex-direction: column;
    }
}

/* Mobile Breakpoint (max-width: 600px) */
@media (max-width: 600px) {
    .bento-grid-background {
        display: none; /* Background grid hidden on mobile */
    }
    .bento-grid-layout-new {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 12px;
    }
    .bento-card-base {
        grid-column: span 1 !important;
        grid-row: auto !important;
        height: auto !important;
    }
}
```

