# 14. LOADING, ERROR, & EMPTY STATES

## Loading States (`.bento-insta-loading`)
Social cards render three shimmer skeleton bars (`header`, `stats`, `grid`) while fetching API data:
```css
@keyframes shimmer {
  0% { background-position: -200% 0; }
  100% { background-position: 200% 0; }
}
.bento-insta-shimmer {
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, #F1F5F9 25%, #E2E8F0 50%, #F1F5F9 75%);
